Serve a model over an OpenAI-compatible API

Usage: wally serve [OPTIONS] [model]

Arguments:
  model                       Model to serve (default qwen3-4b-instruct-2507)

Options:
  -h, --help                  Show help
  -H, --host TEXT             Address to bind (default 127.0.0.1)
  -p, --port UINT             Port to listen on (default 8080)
  -c, --context-length, --context INT
                              Context window in tokens (default 8192)
  -t, --threads INT           Inference threads (default 4)
      --gpu-layers, --ngl INT
                              Layers to offload to the GPU
      --cors                  Allow cross-origin browser requests (off by
                              default)

Examples:
